//RS //! jet CLI: check / build / run / test / new / fmt / try / lsp +
//RS //!          add / remove / fetch / update (M12.1 package manager).
//RS //!
//RS //! The driver owns invariant I2: rustc's voice never reaches the user as
//RS //! if it were their fault. A rustc failure on generated code is reported
//RS //! as an internal compiler error in jet.
